// correct (graft: the same view - the node is intact):
//.
// program: 173_raw_sub_blocks.vish
open_view module
// let: blk @print(1
idle
journal
pointer 1 @print(1 0 55
key 1 1
// expect: курсор:       x += 41‸;
idle
journal
// corrected: number, second subblock, and call block are not all node elements
